<title>USA: American Realty declines comment on stock.</title>
<headline>American Realty declines comment on stock.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Realty Trust Inc on Tuesday declined to comment about recent unusual trading activity involving its stock.</p>
<p>The company said it was contacted by the New York Stock Exchange about its stock but that its is not to comment on variances in the trading volume or price of its shares.</p>
<p>American Realty Trust Inc shares closed up 2-7/8 Tuesday at 22.</p>
